ntroduction-and-yahoo-pipes.html"/></citation></ref><ref id="B24"><citation citation-type="other"><article-title>FortiusOne GeoCommons</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.geocommons.com/"/></citation></ref><ref id="B25"><citation citation-type="other"><article-title>GeoIQ Javascript API documentation</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://geoiq.earthinfomark.com/docs/geoiq_api_doc.pdf"/></citation></ref><ref id="B26"><citation citation-type="other"><article-title>USGS, CDC ArboNet</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://diseasemaps.usgs.gov/"/></citation></ref><ref id="B27"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Zou</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Miller</surname><given-names>SN</given-names></name><name><surname>Schmidtmann</surname><given-names>ET</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A GIS tool to estimate West Nile virus risk based on a degree-day model</article-title><source>Environ Monit Assess</source><year>2007</year><volume>129</volume><fpage>413</fpage><lpage>20</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17106782</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s10661-006-9373-8</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B28"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Allen</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A modified sine wave method for calculating degree days</article-title><source>Environmental Entomology</source><year>1976</year><volume>5</volume><fpage>388</fpage><lpage>396</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B29"><citation citation-type="other"><article-title>NOAA NCDC: National climate data center</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.ncdc.noaa.gov/oa/ncdc.html"/></citation></ref><ref id="B30"><citation citation-type="other"><article-title>CIPRES TreeBASE II: experimental google earth phylogenetic tree server</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.treebase.org/getrees/"/></citation></ref><ref id="B31"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Janies</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Hill</surname><given-names>AW</given-names></name><name><surname>Guralnick</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Habib</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Waltari</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Wheeler</surname><given-names>WC</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Genomic analysis and geographic visualization of the spread of avian influenza (H5N1)</article-title><source>Syst Biol</source><year>2007</year><volume>56</volume><fpage>321</fpage><lpage>9</lpage><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://systbio.org/?q=node/184"/><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17464886</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1080/10635150701266848</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B32"><citation citation-type="other"><article-title>Mesquite Project: A modular system for evolutionary analysis</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://mesquiteproject.org/mesquite/mesquite.html"/></citation></ref><ref id="B33"><citation citation-type="other"><article-title>Semantic web activity statement</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.w3.org/2001/sw/Activity.html"/></citation></ref><ref id="B34"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kamel Boulos</surname><given-names>MN</given-names></name><name><surname>Roudsari</surname><given-names>AV</given-names></name><name><surname>Carson</surname><given-names>ER</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Towards a semantic medical Web: HealthCyberMap's tool for building an RDF metadata base of health information resources based on the Qualified Dublin Core Metadata Set</article-